  "prefLabel": "Diet 303.03 Standards for Approval of College or University",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Diet 303.03 Standards for Approval of College or University. Colleges and universities that are approved by the Accreditation Council for Education in Nutrition and Dietetics (ACEND), or its successor organization, shall be approved.\n\nSource. #8336, eff 5-1-05 (from Diet 303.02), EXPIRED: 5-1-13\n\nNew. #10691, eff 10-9-14 ss by #14235, eff 6-10-25, EXPIRES: 6-10-35\n\nPART 304 FEES",
